To search for issues within a project, use the `filter` argument with `projectId`. The filter syntax is JSON-like:

```graphql
{
  issues(first: 50, filter: { project: { id: { eq: "..." } }, assignee: { id: { eq: "..." } } }) {
    nodes {
      id
      identifier
      title
      priority
      assignee { name }
      project { name }
      cycle { name number }
    }
  }
}
```

